{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1087", "sample_idx": 25, "model_name": "abacusai/dracarys-llama-3.1-70b-instruct", "content": "the social network is a movie that tells the story of the founding of facebook and the subsequent lawsuits that followed. the film is directed by david fincher and written by aaron sorkin, who is known for his fast-paced and witty dialogue.\n\nthe movie starts with mark zuckerberg (played by jesse eisenberg), a sophomore at harvard university, who creates a website called \"facemash\" that becomes a huge success. however, the site also gets him into trouble with the university and he is eventually forced to shut it down.\n\nafter the success of facemash, zuckerberg is approached by cameron and tyler winklevoss (played by armie hammer), who are members of the rowing team at harvard. they ask zuckerberg to help them create a social networking site exclusively for harvard students, which they call \"the harvard connect\".\n\nhowever, zuckerberg has other plans and decides to create his own social networking site, which he calls \"thefacebook\". he enlists the help of his friend eduardo saverin (played by andrew garfield) and the two of them launch the site, which quickly becomes a huge success.\n\nas the site grows in popularity, zuckerberg and saverin become wealthy, but they also face lawsuits from the winklevoss twins, who claim that zuckerberg stole their idea. the movie follows the subsequent lawsuits and the drama that unfolds as the characters clash with each other.\n\nthe social network is a well-crafted movie that features excellent performances from the cast. jesse eisenberg is particularly impressive as mark zuckerberg, bringing a sense of intensity and vulnerability to the character. the supporting cast, including andrew garfield and armie hammer, are also excellent in their roles.\n\nthe movie's cinematography is also noteworthy, with a dark and moody tone that captures the atmosphere of the harvard university campus. the score, composed by trent reznor and atticus ross, is also excellent, adding to the movie's tense and dramatic atmosphere.\n\noverall, the social network is a compelling and engaging movie that tells a fascinating story about the founding of facebook and the subsequent lawsuits that followed. it features excellent performances, cinematography, and a score that all come together to create a movie that is both entertaining and thought-provoking.", "logprobs": [{"token": "the", "logprob": -0.11627468466758728}, {"token": " social", "logprob": -1.6927862816373818e-05}, {"token": " network", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.03940728306770325}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -1.3828373084834311e-05}, {"token": " movie", "logprob": -3.1071083545684814}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.013784566894173622}, {"token": " tells", "logprob": -0.1502644121646881}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.9073504518019035e-06}, {"token": " story", "logprob": -7.629423635080457e-06}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -3.57628505298635e-06}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.1997353732585907}, {"token": " founding", "logprob": -0.02036600559949875}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0006610551499761641}, {"token": " facebook", "logprob": -7.021673809504136e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.1109476312994957}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0005869203014299273}, {"token": " subsequent", "logprob": -0.10487799346446991}, {"token": " lawsuits", "logprob": -0.1260240525007248}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.0034789089113473892}, {"token": " followed", "logprob": -0.004445106256753206}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.002934585325419903}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.027294330298900604}, {"token": " film", "logprob": -0.0033171894028782845}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.01893458142876625}, {"token": " directed", "logprob": -0.029656434431672096}, {"token": " by", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " david", "logprob": -1.1920930376163597e-07}, {"token": " fin", "logprob": -1.1920930376163597e-07}, {"